  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposal, by reason of the lack of family sized homes with three or more\r\nbedrooms and its preponderance of smaller 1-bed units, would fail to achieve an\r\nappropriate housing mix, having regard to the location of the site and its\r\nsurroundings as well as the evidence of local need which identifies the need\r\nfor more larger, family-sized units and would fail to contribute to the\r\ncreation of inclusive and mixed communities, contrary to the provisions of the\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies H1, H2 and H10 of the\r\nLondon Plan (2021) and Policies HO1 and HO2 of the Harrow Local Plan\r\n(2021-2041).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
